{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0105", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_24", "topic_id": "AXIS_24_T02", "question_id": "Q-C02-A24-T02-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事の株価収益率（連結）はFY2025末に25.21倍（FY2024 11.08倍、FY2023 15.15倍）。5年間の株主総利回りは547.0%（比較指標TOPIX 179.0%）、FY2025の最高株価は5,787円。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0372", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0373", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0374", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0375", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "MARKET_DATA", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0106", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_24", "topic_id": "AXIS_24_T02", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "FY2025の三菱商事のPERは25.21倍とFY2024の11.08倍から倍以上に上がったが、同期の1株当たり当期純利益は236.97円から210.92円に減っている。PER上昇は利益の増加ではなく株価の上昇（最高株価5,787円）によるもので、市場が足元の利益より先の利益（あるいは資源価格・株主還元）を織り込んだことを示唆する。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0372", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0376", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0375", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "市場が何を織り込んだかは本資料から識別できない（仮説）。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0107", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_24", "topic_id": "AXIS_24_T07", "question_id": "Q-C02-A24-T07-01", "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事は純投資目的以外の株式として上場30銘柄（貸借対照表計上額518,736百万円）と非上場131銘柄（80,054百万円）を保有し、FY2025に上場10銘柄・122億円を売却して保有残高を前年度末比約2%縮減した。最大はいすゞ自動車（141,328百万円）で、良品計画、日清食品ホールディングス、AYALA、三菱重工業などが続く。取締役会は保有意義が希薄化した銘柄の縮減を検討している。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0377", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0378", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0379", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0380", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0171", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "SHAREHOLDING", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
